M1 ON TWO SEPARATELY PROTECTED PACKS (energy_two_pack.py, stream a1elec, MESHSAT-1357). PROTOTYPE DESIGN: nothing
built, ordered or measured; AI arithmetic, not a qualified review. Model: records/energy/energy_budget.py imported
unchanged (sha256 6a8ac4642bd2aaf3...), its September reference day, chain 0.8467, performance ratio 0.9417, aged 80 percent,
the 3.00 V line with the 5 percent reserve, both start hours (06 and 18 UTC), PS-IDLE-SPEC 42.8 W at the pack terminals.

0. THE PARAMETERS (value; kind and source)
