   base 4S6P and lid 4S12P of the ruled Samsung INR18650-35E; each pack's share of the load at an equal cell current,
   14.27 W and 28.53 W; charge allocation 'ah' (the node's surplus split 6:12 by capacity, each capped, the rest to the
   other); discharge 'ah' (the deficit split 6:12 while both hold energy, then the other alone).

