8. THE JOIN CURRENT: the lid path conducting while the lid's open-circuit voltage is above the base's by dV (TOPOLOGY.md 3c)
   lid loop 41.7 mOhm (cells 4 x 35 / 12 plus the discharge loop of section 0); base loop 39.2 mOhm (cells 4 x 35 / 6, F1 2.52,
   F2 2.0 ESTIMATE, Q1 and Q2 0.69 each, R10 2.0, lead and XT60 3.0 ESTIMATE, R17 5.0); no load on the node (the worst case);
   the LM5069's limit over r_cl is 8.7 to 11.0 A (VCL 48.5 to 61.5 mV, SNVS452G page 6); the table takes the maximum
     dV (V)      I (A)  A a base cell   base OCC1 5.0 A, 2 s  cell max charge 2.0 A
     dV (V)      I (A)  A a base cell   base OCC1 5.0 A, 2 s  cell max charge 2.0 A  LM5069 FET in limit (W)
       0.05       0.62           0.10                  holds                 within             not limiting
       0.10       1.24           0.21                  holds                 within             not limiting
