       4.80      10.98           1.83                  trips                 within            42.7 (linear)
   In current limit the FET takes the gap less the loops' drop: up to the last row's figure until the LM5069's power limit
   and fault timer (PWR and TIMER, sized by board A's owner with SNVS452G's procedure) turn it off; the -2 variant retries.
   A lid pack fuller than the base by 0.20 V (50 mV a cell) pushes at most 2.5 A into the base: under U3's 3.968 A setting.

END. Every row is the record's model on the reference day with the stated departures; none is a demonstration.
